+</div></div></div><div id="tag/Sync/Projects/Move-a-project" data-section-id="tag/Sync/Projects/Move-a-project" class="sc-dcJsrY eVrqat"><div class="sc-kAyceB XMnSL"><div class="sc-fqkvVR hARFxy"><h2 class="sc-dhKdcB ilvzMQ"><a class="sc-jlZhew jrsfjb" href="https://developer.todoist.com/api/v1/#tag/Sync/Projects/Move-a-project" aria-label="tag/Sync/Projects/Move-a-project"></a>Move a project</h2></div></div><div class="sc-fqkvVR bXmbgy"><div class="sc-eeDRCY sc-eBMEME gvJSKt guWXct redoc-markdown "><blockquote>
+<p>Example move project request:</p>
