+</div></div></div><div id="tag/Sync/Workspace-Filters/Add-a-workspace-filter" data-section-id="tag/Sync/Workspace-Filters/Add-a-workspace-filter" class="sc-dcJsrY eVrqat"><div class="sc-kAyceB XMnSL"><div class="sc-fqkvVR hARFxy"><h2 class="sc-dhKdcB ilvzMQ"><a class="sc-jlZhew jrsfjb" href="https://developer.todoist.com/api/v1/#tag/Sync/Workspace-Filters/Add-a-workspace-filter" aria-label="tag/Sync/Workspace-Filters/Add-a-workspace-filter"></a>Add a workspace filter</h2></div></div><div class="sc-fqkvVR bXmbgy"><div class="sc-eeDRCY sc-eBMEME gvJSKt guWXct redoc-markdown "><blockquote>
